From eb3ff5bac381450c7cfd394a610776c755ac26c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:00:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Input: bbqx0kbd - Service what is pending at probe

After the driver loaded, the trackpad stayed quiet until its button was
pressed: an event the controller raised before the interrupt was
requested left no edge behind, and motion stayed queued. Run the handler
once after requesting the interrupt.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/input/keyboard/bbqx0kbd.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/input/keyboard/bbqx0kbd.c b/drivers/input/keyboard/bbqx0kbd.c
index 97a7746f..ed4bfbfc 100644
--- a/drivers/input/keyboard/bbqx0kbd.c
+++ b/drivers/input/keyboard/bbqx0kbd.c
@@ -290,6 +290,9 @@ static int bbqx0kbd_probe(struct i2c_client *client)
 	if (ret)
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "Failed to request IRQ\n");
 
+	/* An event already pending at probe raised its edge before we listened. */
+	bbqx0kbd_irq(client->irq, kbd);
+
 	return bbqx0kbd_init_backlight(kbd);
 }
 
